<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Rwe buys stake in Czech gas distributor.</title>
<headline>Rwe buys stake in Czech gas distributor.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>RWE Energie, a unit of German group RWE AG, said on Friday it had purchased an 11.7 percent stake in Czech regional natural gas distributor Prazska Plynarenska a.s..</p>
</text>
